<title>CANADA: CANADA JULY ADVANCE RAW MATERIALS INDEX FALLS.</title>
<headline>CANADA JULY ADVANCE RAW MATERIALS INDEX FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index is for a 0.5 percent fall in July from June, Statistics Canada said on Monday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			 July</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 +1.8</p>
<p>    Metals			  -3.8</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	-1.0</p>
<p>    Wood			    -0.3</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    -1.3</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
</text>
